	["clear", "Clear selection", "Open Camera and tap Clear, or use the selection card cross, to deselect. This leaves existing unit orders running."],
	["build", "Build", "Select the villagers who should build, choose a building card, preview clear ground in sight, then Place building. Every selected villager builds it; with none selected, the nearest free villager goes. The tile shows artwork and resource costs."],
